<title>DENMARK: Copenhagen Airports 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Copenhagen Airports 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		 422  vs 376</p>
<p> Group net result		     279  vs 247</p>
<p> Group net turnover		  1,395 vs 1,201</p>
<p> Group operating result		485 vs 453</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crown/share)   7.5 vs 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish group is Copenhagen Airports A/S, 51.3 percent state-owned and a smaller nearby airport. It said in a statement that it expected 1997 results to show the same rise as in 1996. The result was below average analysts' expectations of a 298 million crowns net profit for 1996. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969652</p>
</text>
